# CMDEDIT-LBL-04: Ports 1 and 4; port make on C; port make 4 on D; class, connections, renumber, first/last/next (Q-CMDEDIT-92).
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/tiny -noprompt
load a
box 0 0 40 10
paint metal1
box 1 1 1 1
label A
port make 1
box 11 1 11 1
label B
port make 4
box 21 1 21 1
label C
port make
box 31 1 31 1
label D
port make 4
port A class input
port A class
box 1 1 1 1
select area labels
port connections
port renumber
port first
port last
port next 1
save a
